{"id":"langsam","lemma":"langsam","pos":"adv","rank":437,"glosses":["slowly (at a slow pace), gradually, carefully","it's getting to the point where; just about; used to indicate that an event or evaluation may not have fully come about yet, but is approaching that point."],"ipa":"/ˈlaŋzaːm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/71/De-langsam.ogg/De-langsam.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er läuft langsam.","en":"He walks slowly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69470","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null]},{"text":"Warum bist du so langsam?","en":"Why are you so slow?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Das Mädchen lief langsam.","en":"The girl walked slowly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758345","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"girl"},{"g":"to walk","l":"laufen"},null]},{"text":"Meine Großmutter spricht langsam.","en":"My grandmother speaks slowly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593059","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"grandmother"},{"g":"to speak","l":"sprechen"},null]},{"text":"Geh langsam.","en":"Walk slowly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/79898","words":[{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null]}]}